    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/online-school-courses/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online School Courses theme is a modern, responsive, and versatile solution designed for educational institutions, online schools, e-learning platforms, course providers, tutoring centers, training institutes, skill development programs, and professional certification programs. Ideal for online school website templates, course catalogs, e-learning portals, training program layouts, and educational platforms, this theme ensures a user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes dedicated sections for course listings, instructor profiles, student dashboards, testimonials, banners, and strategically placed call-to-action buttons to encourage enrollments and engagement. Built with secure, optimized, and SEO-friendly code, the theme allows easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to match your institution’s branding. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for course purchases, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, and LearnPress for creating and managing online courses, Online School Courses provides a professional, high-performing platform to deliver education online, attract students, and manage learning efficiently."
    },
